# Requiem for the Departed (crystalWar 23), the quest's own var at the completion (missions as the main flow's):
# accepted with the Sheaf of Handmade Incense and Quest[7][23]Prog 1 (GMs). Heptachiond: 107; finished:
# npcUtil.completeQuest (the Scroll of Recall-Meriph, completed), then the incense taken. npcUtil.completeQuest does no
# cleanup: Quest[7][23]Prog stays 1 (quest:complete's cleanup would clear it).
lists TheEldiemeNecropolisS/Heptachiond/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolisS/onEventFinish/107
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolisS pos=257.696,-31.999,20.073 job=WAR lvl=99
keyitem BronzeRibbonOfService
mission Asa BurgeoningDread current
mission Acp ACrystallineProphecyFin current
mission Rov ARhapsodyForTheAges current
mission Soa Abomination current
quest CrystalWar.RequiemForTheDeparted accepted
keyitem SheafOfHandmadeIncense
charvar Quest[7][23]Prog 1              # a GM: the quest's own var
login
trigger Heptachiond                     # the incense: 107
finish                                  # the Scroll of Recall-Meriph; completed, Prog kept; the incense taken
trigger Heptachiond                     # completed: 108
finish
